          "name": "Bernadine Bluntly",
          "version": "0.1.0",
          "description": "A profile of Bernadine Bluntly, a YouTuber and commentator who rose as a \"tradwife\" influencer and now speaks about leaving the movement. Built from her own pages and public references; anything thinly sourced is marked to check.",
