        }
      ],
      "handles": [
        {
          "id": "root",
          "key": "root",
          "label": "root",
          "direction": "input",
          "dataType": "any",
          "angle": 270,
          "portId": "root"
        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "bernadine-bluntly-demo"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;background:#faf7f0;font-family:Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;min-height:100%;padding:4.4cqw 7cqw 5cqw'><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e'>Profile</div><div style='font:700 5.8cqw/1.1 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;margin:1.4cqw 0 .8cqw;color:#1f2937'>Bernadine Bluntly</div><div style='font:400 2.1cqw/1.5 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:2cqw;max-width:60cqw'>YouTuber, writer and commentator on feminism, motherhood and relationships. Rose as a &quot;tradwife&quot; influencer, and now speaks publicly about leaving the movement. Her YouTube channel has about 141,000 subscribers.</div><div style='margin-top:2.6cqw;padding:1.4cqw 2cqw;border-radius:1.2cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:600 1.5cqw/1.5 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif'>3 facts to check: Born, Profiled by the New York Times, Writing for Evie Magazine</div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>Life</div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 11cqw;font:800 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f766e'>1990</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Born<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Born in the United States on June 1, 1990, according to Famous Birthdays. That site is a thin source, so the date is worth confirming.</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 11cqw;font:800 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f766e'>Jan 2021</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Starts posting on TikTok</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Her first posts on TikTok, per Famous Birthdays.</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 11cqw;font:800 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f766e'>Jun 2022</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Grows on Instagram</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Expands onto Instagram, per Famous Birthdays. Instagram is now her main presence, with healing, motherhood and &quot;new era&quot; messaging.</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 11cqw;font:800 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f766e'>Feb 2023</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Begins YouTube Shorts</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Starts uploading YouTube Shorts, per Famous Birthdays.</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 11cqw;font:800 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f766e'>Jul 2025</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Silver Play Button</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Receives YouTube&#39;s Silver Play Button, the award for 100,000 subscribers, per Famous Birthdays.</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:2.4cqw;margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='flex:0 0 11cqw;font:800 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#0f766e'>Sep 2026</div><div style='min-width:0;flex:1'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Profiled by the New York Times<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>The Times publishes a profile of her path from tradwife influencer to leaving the movement and her marriage. The article was behind a paywall and not read for this profile, so what it says is not summarized here.</div></div></div><div style='font:700 1.3cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0f766e;margin:4cqw 0 1.6cqw;padding-top:2cqw;border-top:.15cqw solid rgba(15,118,110,.35)'>Works</div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>YouTube channel</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>youtube.com/@BernadineBluntly: reaction and commentary videos on culture, feminism, masculinity, femininity, motherhood and relationships. A mix of older tradwife-era videos and newer commentary.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Instagram</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>instagram.com/bernadinebluntly: her main presence now, with healing, motherhood and &quot;new era&quot; messaging.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>TikTok</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>Short videos, posting since January 2021 per Famous Birthdays.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>X / Twitter</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>x.com/bernadineblntly. The handle drops a letter from her name.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Threads</div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>threads.com/@bernadinebluntly.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:2cqw'><div style='font:700 1.9cqw/1.3 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#1f2937'>Writing for Evie Magazine<span style='display:inline-block;margin-left:1cqw;padding:.2cqw 1cqw;border-radius:9cqw;background:#fffbeb;border:1px solid #fde68a;color:#92400e;font:700 1.2cqw/1.4 Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;vertical-align:middle'>to check</span></div><div style='font:400 1.7cqw/1.55 Georgia,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,serif;color:#334155;margin-top:.4cqw'>An article on her Evie Magazine author page, &quot;How Modern Day Feminism Fails To Be Pro-Women&quot;. The page gives no date, and it is older writing from her tradwife period.</div></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail: the profile as one page, written from the cards. The Method writes it, so edit the cards and not this.",
